# Copy this to ".env.dispatcher-path" in the project root. dispatcher.sh sources it every
# tick, separately from .env, because Expo CLI refuses to load any .env file that defines
# PATH -- see the note at the top of .env.example.
#
# cron uses a minimal PATH. Add wherever `claude`, `jq`, and `gh` live.
#    Find them with:  which claude ; which jq ; which gh
#    Common spots: Homebrew on Apple Silicon = /opt/homebrew/bin, Intel = /usr/local/bin
PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin
